    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pgvectorscale 让向量索引落盘并支持混合检索",
      "summary": "Christophe Pettus 实测 Tiger Data 的 pgvectorscale，并给出不靠 Elasticsearch 的混合检索写法。其核心是 StreamingDiskANN 索引：完整向量留在 SSD 上，内存只放压缩向量用于遍历估距，配合每维一到两位的统计二值量化，绕开 HNSW 必须常驻内存的限制；标签过滤在遍历中生效。他在 100 万条 1536 维向量上测得 p95 延迟约为 HNSW 的九分之一。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/on-pgvectorscale-and-hybrid-search-without-an-elasticsearch-sidecar/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-04-30",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/517aabda6645483b8c313947d977130a.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "向量检索",
        "扩展",
        "索引"
      ],
      "position": 6
